{"version":1,"key":"card:388","content":{"id":388,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"Tapable","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是 Webpack 实现插件机制的模块，在 Webpack 的内部通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Tapable","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 预定义各个阶段的 Hook，插件可以通过为这些 Hook 注册处理事件来获取该阶段的编译信息甚至修改编译信息。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bfa41299-c0c9-4830-b89a-4f4855939eab","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"Tapable","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 有点类似于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"EventEmitter","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，不同的是，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"EventEmitter","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 注册的事件的执行只有一种同步执行的流程，而 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Tapable","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 针对 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Webpack","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的应用场景，抽象出来了九种不同的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Hook","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，分别是：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"63ec308c-1493-40e1-be98-76862b39c1e4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"SyncHook","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"40a27fd5-0a46-4615-81c5-f087cfc83b15","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"9c774cf5-793e-4759-8bc7-cf6f2714cabc","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"SyncBailHook","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a1cede3e-b80f-4644-a5a5-4f8e1d0f4cbc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"97392bbf-76ad-46f1-915f-0465a80085e5","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"SyncWaterfallHook","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bf3bdbca-d86e-4906-8cf8-133ed8656a8b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"416003f1-2525-4188-b820-6cc66f5fa761","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"SyncLoopHook","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d9005374-8f41-4d80-9cf7-a74d9e52a3ec","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2c0f3027-5a7f-4f7a-b4de-c51add003f1f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"AsyncParallelHook","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e83f0a84-0c58-4320-a82f-56970b971571","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2f2aa96b-caa7-452e-ba2c-ae5d57d09aa2","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"AsyncParallelBailHook","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"67f76507-19d9-438e-9474-98e6f68d128b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"27eebfac-1df3-496d-b275-eaa46d599f91","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"AsyncSeriesHook","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2e723520-4b73-4a06-9f0a-e56b20aef1fa","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"3af270a0-9ea7-4bc0-a1b2-e3be7a3a7ea0","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"AsyncSeriesBailHook","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"51f12e19-faa0-43cd-a9c4-c87a49d6e0d8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"e8fe77ba-5df1-4e00-b431-acdc0a74832f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"AsyncSeriesWaterfallHook","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e77d47e8-93a6-4073-8acc-331b98d9f672","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"160a7b6a-aa2a-48e8-b9e5-2652f4158a36","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"071c68c8-96c6-4e30-b557-62a1e31e3706","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"整体上分为两类，以 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"SyncHook","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 为代表的同步 Hook 和以 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"AsyncSerierHook","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 为代表的异步 Hook。在创建 Hook 对象时，我们需要传入一个字符串数组，用来表示该 Hook 触发时传递的参数。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"85b1a485-7b70-4aca-95f5-671991375aff","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"对于同步 Hook，通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"tap","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 来注册一个事件，它接受两个参数，第一个参数可以是一个字符串或者一个对象，这个字符串表示这个事件的名称，如果是一个对象，可以配置如下三个属性：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"12c3b7b9-457f-4672-ac2d-5663e8a1f922","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"name","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：事件名称，同设置的字符串相同","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5f284620-40ed-448e-ac5d-fda2641f5a9e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"5afdc84d-1742-49a1-a69b-08ff6ea0bde8","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"before","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：设置这个事件在某个事件之前，可以是一个数组","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0291e5b5-d027-4228-9084-305f43e77199","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"d9f8cf02-657a-4e33-ba98-64141cd5d13a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"stage","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：一个数字，数字越小执行时机越靠前，默认是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"0","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"416c0fc3-2dbb-462c-b0f9-acb9256d779f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"117c7dd8-67ef-4860-8d72-02bb28a630c2","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"2267bfb6-8c12-42a7-8181-dbd09b05d402","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"第二个参数是处理函数，其接受的参数应同创建 Hook 时声明的参数相同。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fa5047a9-834e-43ad-8015-42e471e5b7de","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"import { SyncHook } from \"tapable\";\n\nconst syncHook = new SyncHook([\"name\", \"age\"]);\n\n// 通过 tap 注册事件\nsyncHook.tap({\n  name: \"name1\"\n}, (name, age) => {\n  \n});\n\nsyncHook.tap('name2', (name, age) => {\n  \n});\n\n// 通过 call 方法触发所有的事件\nsyncHook.call(name, age, () => {\n  // onDone\n});","collabId":"75c7ea53-d244-40d2-873a-7113c33c30e5","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"ee23a8a7-726c-4991-8823-f63e1a3f39ae","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b9ac74a1-eb15-42ba-b337-bfcbda8f581c"},{"children":[{"text":"对于异步 Hook，一般通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"tapAsync","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 或 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"tapPromise","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 来注册一个事件，对于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"tapAsync","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，第一个参数同 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"tap","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 相同，第二个参数接受的回调函数的最后一个参数会传入一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"callback","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 函数，该函数的调用表示该异步函数处理完成，通常用以调度后续异步任务的执行。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"61cea08b-50a9-4569-bb22-a4f51415f5d0","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":[],"createTime":1702736266903,"updateTime":1793532523784,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532523784}}